[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_13]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_13_desc]
“The more muffins, the more blueberries on the muffins; the more blueberries on the muffins, the tastier the muffins; the tastier the muffins, the more muffins are eaten; the more muffins are eaten, the fewer muffins there are. So the more muffins, the fewer muffins there are.”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_13_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about research, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_13]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_13_desc]
“马芬越多，马芬上的蓝莓越多；马芬上的蓝莓越多，马芬越好吃；马芬越好吃，马芬被吃掉的越多；马芬被吃掉的越多，马芬越少。所以马芬越多，马芬越少。”

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_13_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于科研的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

